[138.020332, "i", "cat > FIXES.txt << 'EOF'\nETL Pipeline Makefile Fixes\n============================\n\nPROBLEM SUMMARY:\n- Incremental builds were broken (touching one source file rebuilt everything)\n- Second run after touching files caused segfaults or hangs\n- Issues appeared after adding -j4 parallel flag but persisted after removal\n\nROOT CAUSES IDENTIFIED:\n\n1. BUG #1: Pattern rule used $$@ without .SECONDEXPANSION\n   - The clean/%.csv rule had \"python3 scripts/clean.py $< $$@\"\n   - Without .SECONDEXPANSION, $$@ was treated as literal \"$@\" in first expansion\n   - This caused incorrect output paths\n\n2. BUG #2: $(wildcard clean/*.csv) evaluated at parse time\n   - joined.csv depended on $(wildcard clean/*.csv)\n   - Wildcard is evaluated when Makefile is parsed, not when rule runs\n   - After first build, this became a fixed list, breaking incremental builds\n   - Touching a source file would update clean/*.csv but joined.csv wouldn't rebuild\n\n3. BUG #3: Race condition with parallel builds\n   - clean/manifest.txt had no dependency on"]
[138.020464, "i", " $(CLEAN_TARGETS)\n   - With -j4, manifest could be generated before all cleaning finished\n   - This caused incomplete manifests and segfaults in join.py\n\n4. BUG #4: Missing config/params.yaml dependency\n   - summary.csv rule didn't list config/params.yaml as dependency\n   - summarize.py reads this file but changes weren't triggering rebuilds\n\nFIXES APPLIED:\n\n1. Added .SECONDEXPANSION: directive at top of Makefile\n   - Changed $$@ to $@ in pattern rule (now expands correctly with .SECONDEXPANSION)\n\n2. Replaced $(wildcard clean/*.csv) with $(CLEAN_TARGETS)\n   - CLEAN_TARGETS is computed from SOURCES, tracks dependencies properly\n   - joined.csv now correctly depends on the variable, not parse-time wildcard\n\n3. Made clean/manifest.txt depend on $(CLEAN_TARGETS)\n   - Ensures manifest is only generated after all cleaning completes\n   - Eliminates race condition in parallel builds\n\n4. Added config/params.yaml to summary.csv dependencies\n   - Changes to config now correctly trigger summary rebuild\n\nTEST RESULTS:\n✓"]
[138.020499, "o", "cat > FIXES.txt << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r $(CLEAN_TARGETS)\r\n   - With -j4, manifest could be generated before all cleaning finished\r\n   - "]
[138.020532, "i", " Clean build works correctly\n✓ Incremental builds work (touch one file, only that chain rebuilds)\n✓ Parallel builds (-j4) work without race conditions or segfaults\n✓ Config changes trigger only summary rebuild\n✓ Multiple simultaneous source changes handled correctly in parallel\n\nThe pipeline now works correctly for all scenarios.\nEOF\n"]
[138.020558, "o", "This caused incomplete manifests and segfaults in join.py\r\n\r\n4. BUG #4: Missing config/params.yaml dependency\r\n   - summary.csv rule didn't list config/pa"]
[138.020586, "o", "rams.yaml as dependency\r\n   - summarize.py reads this file but changes weren't tr"]
[138.020623, "o", "iggering rebuilds\r\n\r\nFIXES APPLIED:\r\n\r\n1. Added .SECONDEXPANSION: directive at top of Makefile\r\n   - Changed $$@ to $@ in pattern rule (now ex"]
[138.020657, "o", "pands correctly with .SECONDEXPANSION)\r\n\r\n2. Replaced $(wild"]
[138.020689, "o", "card clean/*.csv) with $(CLEAN_TARGETS)\r\n   - CLEAN_TARGETS is computed from SOURCES, tracks dependencies prope"]
[138.020726, "o", "rly\r\n   - joined.csv now correctly depends on the variable, not parse-time wildcard\r\n\r\n3. Mad"]
[138.020758, "o", "e clean/manifest.txt depend on $(CLEAN_TARGETS)\r\n   - Ensu"]
[138.020791, "o", "res manifest is only generated after all cleaning completes\r\n   - Eliminates race condition in parallel builds\r\n\r\n4. Ad"]
[138.020823, "o", "ded config/params.yaml to summary.csv dependencies\r\n   - Changes to config"]
[138.020855, "o", " now correctly trigger summary rebuild\r\n\r\nTEST RESULTS:\r\n✓"]
[138.020886, "o", " Clean build works correctly\r\n✓ Incremental builds work (touch one file, only that chain rebuilds)\r\n✓ Parallel builds (-j4) work without"]
[138.020914, "o", " race conditions or segfaults\r\n✓ Config changes trigger only summary rebuild\r\n✓"]
